DEMO.md COVERAGE
----------------
10 steps:
  1. Start platform (make up)
  2. Create topics + start producers (make init-topics + make producers-up)
  3. Build Flink image + start cluster (podman build + make flink-up)
  4. Submit Flink SQL jobs (make submit-sql)
  5. Start KPI poller (make kpi-poller-up)
  6. Seed Qdrant (make seed-kb + make seed)
  7. Train MLflow model (make train + make promote)
  8. Explore Streamlit Dashboard (all 5 tabs with example queries)
  9. Run smoke test (make smoke-test)
  10. Explore Marquez lineage graph

MAKEFILE TARGETS SUMMARY (FINAL)
----------------------------------
make up                  # Start full stack
make down                # Stop all containers
make init-topics         # Create Kafka topics
make producers-up        # Start 4 producers
make producers-down      # Stop producers
make producers-logs      # Follow producer logs
make flink-up            # Start Flink cluster + SQL client
make flink-logs          # Follow Flink logs
make submit-sql          # Submit all 5 Flink SQL jobs
make submit-job JOB=X    # Submit single job by name
make kpi-poller-up       # Start KPI cache poller
make kpi-poller-logs     # Follow poller logs
make seed                # Seed both Qdrant collections
make seed-kb             # Seed regulatory KB only
make train               # Train MLflow fraud model
make promote             # Promote Staging -> Production
make smoke-test          # Full integration test
make verify-lineage      # Check Marquez DAG only
make reset               # Wipe volumes + restart
